      "content": "hey, we have a situation. the dev team just confirmed that an S3 bucket was misconfigured and left some user emails exposed for a few days. it's only about 50 people but if the press gets wind that we had a \"leak\" due to a configuration error, our trust metrics are going to tank. how do we frame this to the media so it doesn't look like a security failure or a mistake on our part?",
