      "content": "a \"proactive enhancement\"? i mean i get the angle, but if a tech journalist specifically asks if there was an actual period where data was accessible to the public due to a setup error, how do we answer that without lying? i don't want to get caught in a direct contradiction if they digging into the logs.",
